### 5.4 네이버 웹 크롤링 (Light - 10개 기사)
POST {{baseUrl}}/news/crawl/naver
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "officeId": "001",
  "categoryId": "100",
  "maxArticles": 10,
  "maxScrollAttempts": 10,
  "sessionId": "test_crawl_light_001"
}

