### 5.7 크롤링 요청 (권한 없이 - 실패 예상)
POST {{baseUrl}}/news/crawl/naver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "officeId": "001",
  "categoryId": "100",
  "maxArticles": 5
}

### 5.8 잘못된 파라미터 (최소값 미만)
POST {{baseUrl}}/news/crawl/naver
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "officeId": "001",
  "categoryId": "100",
  "maxArticles": 0,
  "maxScrollAttempts": 3
}

### 5.9 잘못된 파라미터 (최대값 초과)
POST {{baseUrl}}/news/crawl/naver
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "officeId": "001",
  "categoryId": "100",
  "maxArticles": 150,
  "maxScrollAttempts": 60
}